            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M11",
            "speaker_id": 123706,
            "reply_to": "M10",
            "text": "That would be part of 'Data Gathering' when a lending need is identified. We can specify that in the process documentation for A1, but we don't need it as a separate top-level step in the advisory workflow itself. The proposed 5 steps are at the right level.",
            "mentions": [
              3561
