          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 123706,
            "reply_to": "M20",
            "text": "Thanks. I've reviewed A2 and the doc list for T9. The guidelines in A2 are a good start, but they're missing explicit warnings about providing advice on unregulated investments, which is a major risk point. We also need to add a section on data privacy and client consent. For T9, the list needs to include a signed copy of the advisory agreement and the client's risk profile questionnaire. I've added these as suggestions in the document.",
