      {
        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Define KPIs, data sources, and expectations for pilot performance tracking.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M35",
            "speaker_id": 123706,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, for T4, I've drafted the KPI and Reporting Specification, which you can find in A4. I've focused on metrics we can reliably pull from existing systems, as per the project constraints. The main proposed KPIs are: 1. Number of advisory plans created, 2. Average time to complete a plan, 3. Product conversion rate per plan, and 4. Client satisfaction score (from a post-session survey). Please provide your feedback.",
            "mentions": [
              411661,
              239050,
              3561,
              7338
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4",
              "T4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bar_chart",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M36",
            "speaker_id": 411661,
            "reply_to": "M35",
            "text": "This is a great, clean list @123706. I especially like the focus on conversion rate, as that's a key business driver. I've already cross-checked the data fields for KPIs 1-3, and they look solid. We can get that data.",
            "mentions": [
              123706
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M37",
            "speaker_id": 239050,
            "reply_to": "M35",
            "text": "This is good. Should we also track 'share of wallet' growth for clients in the program? It would be a great indicator of success.",
            "mentions": [
              123706
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M38",
            "speaker_id": 123706,
            "reply_to": "M37",
            "text": "That's a valuable long-term metric, but unfortunately, calculating 'share of wallet' requires external data we don't have in our core systems. It violates one of our key constraints. We can propose it for a future phase, but for the pilot, we need to stick to what's readily available. The four I proposed are all confirmed as feasible.",
            "mentions": [
              239050
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D6"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 239050,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "Ah, right. Good catch on the constraint. The proposed four are fine then.",
            "mentions": [
              123706
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 3561,
            "reply_to": "M35",
            "text": "Why is there no KPI for advisor compliance score?",
            "mentions": [
              123706
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 123706,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "Compliance will be measured through file audits using the A5 checklist, which is more of a qualitative control than a quantitative KPI we can track in real-time on a dashboard. We can report on audit pass/fail rates separately, but it's not a primary performance KPI for this dashboard.",
            "mentions": [
              3561
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M42",
            "speaker_id": 3561,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "I see.",
            "mentions": [
              123706
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 411661,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "Okay, so we're aligned that the four proposed KPIs are the right ones and are feasible with current data. Let's make that official.",
            "mentions": [
              123706
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5",
              "D6"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "gavel",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
