          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 123706,
            "reply_to": "M43",
            "text": "Confirmed. I will finalize A4 with this set of KPIs and hand it over to the IT reporting specialist. This also gives me what I need to draft the pilot evaluation criteria for T10.",
            "mentions": [
              411661
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
