        "thread_goal": "Review pilot results and agree on adjustments before wider rollout.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M64",
            "speaker_id": 239050,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, the pilot in Northwood and Riverdale is complete. I've summarized the results and feedback in the Pilot Evaluation Report A7, which covers T11. Overall, the feedback is positive, but there are a few areas for improvement. Please review and share your thoughts on next steps.",
            "mentions": [
              411661,
              123706,
              3561,
              7338
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7",
              "T11"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "tada",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M65",
            "speaker_id": 411661,
            "reply_to": "M64",
            "text": "Great news! Reading through A7 now. The increase in product conversion rate is fantastic. It seems the biggest operational issue was the time spent on data entry for the new template. We should look for ways to streamline that.",
            "mentions": [
              239050
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M66",
            "speaker_id": 123706,
            "reply_to": "M64",
            "text": "Thanks for compiling this. I'm looking at the KPI data in A7. The 'Average time to complete a plan' is about 25% higher than our target. As @411661 noted, advisor feedback points to the initial data gathering step. Perhaps we can pre-populate some fields from the core system before the client meeting? That could be a quick win.",
            "mentions": [
              239050,
              411661
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "chart_with_upwards_trend",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M67",
            "speaker_id": 239050,
            "reply_to": "M66",
            "text": "That's a great suggestion. I'll add that to the list of adjustments. The client satisfaction scores were very high, which is a big win.",
            "mentions": [
              123706
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M68",
            "speaker_id": 7338,
            "reply_to": "M64",
            "text": "The feedback on the training was good. Some advisors asked for a one-page quick reference guide for the playbooks. Maybe we can create that before the next rollout.",
            "mentions": [
              239050
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M69",
            "speaker_id": 3561,
            "reply_to": "M64",
            "text": "Did we have any compliance issues during the pilot?",
            "mentions": [
              239050
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M70",
            "speaker_id": 123706,
            "reply_to": "M69",
            "text": "The report in A7 mentions that the file audits showed a 95% pass rate, which is excellent for a new process. The 5% of failures were mostly missing signatures on one of the forms, which is an easy fix with a checklist reminder. No major compliance breaches.",
            "mentions": [
              3561
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M71",
            "speaker_id": 411661,
            "reply_to": "M70",
            "text": "This is all very positive. It sounds like we have a clear set of minor adjustments to make, not a fundamental redesign. I propose we move forward with a wider rollout after implementing these changes.",
            "mentions": [
              123706
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "rocket",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M72",
            "speaker_id": 123706,
            "reply_to": "M71",
            "text": "I agree. Let's summarize the agreed adjustments from T11: \n1. Investigate pre-populating the financial planning template to reduce data entry time. \n2. Create a one-page quick reference guide for advisors. \n3. Add a hard stop in the process to ensure all signatures are collected before a file is closed. \nWith these in place, we should be ready for a broader launch.",
            "mentions": [
              411661
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T11"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "clipboard",
